    "html": "<p>Capping how many requests a client may make in a period of time, to protect a service and share its capacity fairly.</p>\n        <p><a href=\"docs/token-bucket-rate-limiting.html\">Token bucket rate limiting</a> explains the most common algorithm.</p>",
