    "term": "Retry-After",
    "aliases": [],
    "html": "<p>An HTTP response header that tells the client how long to wait before retrying, sent with <code>429</code> or <code>503</code>.</p>\n        <p><a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110#field.retry-after\">RFC 9110 §10.2.3</a></p>",
