    "html": "<p>Small, fast on-chip memory shared by the threads of one <a href=\"docs/glossary.html#threadgroup\">threadgroup</a>: at most 32 KiB per threadgroup on Apple GPUs. HLSL calls it <code>groupshared</code>.</p>",
